&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>а ещё можно установить &lt;strong>virtio-win-guest-tools.exe&lt;/strong> от туда же &lt;a href="https://fedorapeople.org/groups/virt/virtio-win/direct-downloads/archive-virtio/">virtio-win&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Удаление строк bash</title><link>https://artyvr.ru/posts/remove_comm_lines_from_file/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 18:27:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://artyvr.ru/posts/remove_comm_lines_from_file/</guid><description>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
